@page "/"

<PageTitle>Biljettbokningssystemet</PageTitle>

<div class="container">
    <h1>Välkommen till Biljettbokningssystemet</h1>
    <p class="lead">MVP, lågkostnadsplattform för biljettbokning byggd med .NET 8 Blazor Server.</p>

    <p>Projektet är i utvecklingsfas. Mer funktionalitet kommer stegvis.</p>

    <div class="tech-overview">
        <h3>Infrastructure & Deployment</h3>
        <p>
            <strong>Hosting:</strong> Azure App Service (Linux, .NET 8, Basic B1 tier, Sweden Central)<br>
            <strong>IaC:</strong> Bicep modules → Environment-specific deployments (dev/prod)<br>
            <strong>CI/CD:</strong> GitHub Actions → Docker build → GHCR → App Service container deployment<br>
            <strong>Custom Domain:</strong> ticket.mymh.dev with Let's Encrypt SSL (manual DNS-01 validation)<br>
            <strong>Monitoring:</strong> Azure Application Insights (telemetry, logging, performance tracking)
        </p>

        <h3>Application Stack</h3>
        <p>
            <strong>Frontend:</strong> .NET 8 Blazor Server (server-side rendering, real-time updates)<br>
            <strong>API:</strong> .NET 8 Web API (Controller-based, planned for business logic)<br>
            <strong>Database:</strong> Azure Cosmos DB Serverless (NoSQL, pay-per-request, ticketing database)<br>
            <strong>Container:</strong> Docker multi-stage build (SDK for build, ASP.NET runtime for production)<br>
            <strong>Registry:</strong> GitHub Container Registry (GHCR, public images, no authentication needed)
        </p>

        <h3>Data & Storage</h3>
        <p>
            <strong>Database:</strong> Cosmos DB Serverless (database: ticketing, container: bookings)<br>
            <strong>Partition Key:</strong> /customerId (enables efficient customer-based queries)<br>
            <strong>Cost Model:</strong> Pay-per-request (zero cost when idle, perfect for MVP)
        </p>

        <h3>Security & Authentication</h3>
        <p>
            <strong>CI/CD Auth:</strong> Azure OIDC (secretless GitHub Actions → Azure authentication)<br>
            <strong>Secrets:</strong> Azure Key Vault (deployed, ready for connection strings and API keys)<br>
            <strong>Identity:</strong> Minimal authentication structure (hardcoded admin for dev, will be replaced with ASP.NET Identity/Entra ID)<br>
            <strong>Network:</strong> App Service with custom domain and SSL/TLS encryption
        </p>
    </div>

    <p class="text-muted">Version status: / Currently on week 4 of the Project</p>
</div>
